20:23:23  == Your files
20:23:23  ClaudeOS can't open macOS's own files: on this Mac they're always encrypted, with keys only macOS can use
20:23:23  (FileVault or not). So setup copies the folders you choose onto a drive called ClaudeOS that both systems open;
20:23:23  macOS keeps its own copies. What you save on that drive in ClaudeOS is in macOS too, and you can send more
20:23:23  later (run setup again).
